[
{
"start": 16.08,
"end": 21.18,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Linear is the incident management platform built for speed \u2013 designed for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 15,
"char_end": 102,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 21.24,
"end": 22.56,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Try linear.com today.",
"char_start": 103,
"char_end": 124,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 22.56,
"end": 30.54,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Before we get started, Javier Benavides was on the show discussing how drainage is the design decision with the biggest impact.",
"char_start": 125,
"char_end": 252,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 30.54,
"end": 31.2,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 266,
"char_end": 279,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 31.26,
"end": 33.84,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "And it connects to what we're going to be discussing today.",
"char_start": 280,
"char_end": 339,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 33.84,
"end": 39.42,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "I want to point out something \u2013 Javier Benavides mentioned this same dynamic a couple of episodes ago.",
"char_start": 355,
"char_end": 457,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 210.0,
"end": 211.74,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Tell me a specific example.",
"char_start": 458,
"char_end": 485,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 211.8,
"end": 215.58,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 486,
"char_end": 536,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 215.58,
"end": 221.04,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Honestly, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 550,
"char_end": 642,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 221.1,
"end": 223.74,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox components.",
"char_start": 643,
"char_end": 697,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 223.8,
"end": 227.22,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 698,
"char_end": 767,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 227.22,
"end": 228.78,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 783,
"char_end": 816,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 228.84,
"end": 232.62,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 817,
"char_end": 867,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 232.62,
"end": 232.98,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Sure.",
"char_start": 881,
"char_end": 886,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 233.04,
"end": 239.7,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing are usually more important than minor suspension adjustments.",
"char_start": 887,
"char_end": 992,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 239.76,
"end": 243.54,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "The frame matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 993,
"char_end": 1063,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 243.54,
"end": 244.62,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 1079,
"char_end": 1097,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 244.68,
"end": 248.46,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1098,
"char_end": 1148,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 248.46,
"end": 255.18,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Honestly, risk management in cycling isn't about avoiding crashes altogether; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 1162,
"char_end": 1289,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 255.24,
"end": 257.82,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "We've seen it in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 1290,
"char_end": 1341,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 257.88,
"end": 261.84,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "If you ignore that, you'll end up rebuilding it from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1342,
"char_end": 1416,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 261.84,
"end": 263.58,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Where does that stop working?",
"char_start": 1432,
"char_end": 1461,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 263.58,
"end": 268.14,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 1475,
"char_end": 1551,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 268.2,
"end": 272.46,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1552,
"char_end": 1623,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 272.46,
"end": 275.34,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always fall back on?",
"char_start": 1639,
"char_end": 1690,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 275.4,
"end": 278.1,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this landscape?",
"char_start": 1691,
"char_end": 1739,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 278.1,
"end": 278.94,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1753,
"char_end": 1773,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 279.0,
"end": 286.32,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the track sections change the choice of racing line between practice sessions and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 1774,
"char_end": 1900,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 840.0,
"end": 841.56,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 1916,
"char_end": 1949,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 841.62,
"end": 845.04,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "What is the version of the question that truly matters?",
"char_start": 1950,
"char_end": 2005,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 845.04,
"end": 847.62,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Let me give you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 2019,
"char_end": 2071,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 847.68,
"end": 852.3,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 2072,
"char_end": 2154,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 852.36,
"end": 855.0,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 2155,
"char_end": 2198,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 855.06,
"end": 859.32,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 2199,
"char_end": 2267,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 859.32,
"end": 861.06,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 2283,
"char_end": 2320,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 861.12,
"end": 865.8,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "What is the operating angle that most listeners do not have access to?",
"char_start": 2321,
"char_end": 2391,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 865.8,
"end": 873.12,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Yes, look \u2013 tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than a minor suspension adjustment.",
"char_start": 2405,
"char_end": 2514,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 873.18,
"end": 876.96,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "The frame matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 2515,
"char_end": 2585,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 876.96,
"end": 878.7,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Tell me a specific example.",
"char_start": 2601,
"char_end": 2628,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 878.76,
"end": 882.18,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "What is the version of the question that truly matters?",
"char_start": 2629,
"char_end": 2684,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 882.18,
"end": 888.72,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Yes, look \u2013 risk management in cycling isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 2698,
"char_end": 2816,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 888.78,
"end": 891.42,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox components.",
"char_start": 2817,
"char_end": 2871,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 891.48,
"end": 894.9,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 2872,
"char_end": 2934,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 894.9,
"end": 896.4,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Tell me more about that.",
"char_start": 2950,
"char_end": 2974,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 896.4,
"end": 900.96,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 2988,
"char_end": 3064,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 901.02,
"end": 905.82,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3065,
"char_end": 3131,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s02"
},
{
"start": 905.82,
"end": 906.9,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 3147,
"char_end": 3169,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 906.96,
"end": 910.68,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of enduro racing?",
"char_start": 3170,
"char_end": 3226,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 910.68,
"end": 919.08,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "It boils down to this: the erosion patterns on the track sections change the optimal racing line between practice sessions and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 3240,
"char_end": 3387,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 919.14,
"end": 922.56,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 3388,
"char_end": 3450,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 1320.0,
"end": 1324.5,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Let's change the subject \u2013 I want to dedicate the final part to risk management.",
"char_start": 3466,
"char_end": 3546,
"unit_id": "t0026.u01",
"sent_id": "t0026.s01"
},
{
"start": 1324.5,
"end": 1333.26,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "That's where the conversation gets interesting, because the considerations surrounding risk management permeate everything we've discussed.",
"char_start": 3560,
"char_end": 3699,
"unit_id": "t0027.u01",
"sent_id": "t0027.s01"
},
{
"start": 1333.26,
"end": 1335.0,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
